,"shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"iSRTaT9WngzB8JJ2YKJUig","review_id":"KWLQOsfaGpna5M_vU7UkGA","date":"2015-11-10T15:36:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9438793063163757,"text_excerpt":"Pro tip: Go early (8:00 a.m.) during the weekend to avoid long lines. Totes worth it, even if you're hungover. My friend and I ate breakfast here on our way out of NOLA. I got the ham po'boy. I know, I know, it's pretty tame, but after several days of heavy Cajun cuisine, I was really looking forward to something a little more...plain. And while it was a cold cut sandwich, essentially, it was quite stellar. Great bread, great dressing, and a nice portion. My friend had the Cajun omelet with grits and proclaimed it delicious. We both enjoyed cups of coffee and chicory, which basically is a must with every meal here. So delicious. Service was fast and friendly. The lady serving our area eve..."},{"business_id":"iSRTaT9WngzB8JJ2YKJUig","review_id":"Mvlhm4Hh5ydmea3CD4mDfg","date":"2015-10-21T19:06:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.938934862613678,"text_excerpt":"Came to Mother's when I visited New Orleans with my friends - one of whom is a Louisiana and New Orleans native. He brought us to Mother's after a night of hard partying in the French Quarter. There was a bit of a line but it was worth the wait (we went and ordered their bloody Mary's and waited in line with them). Loved the cafeteria style of ordering and then having the waitresses bring the larger dishes to our table. Ordered the shrimp po'boy - which was delicious. Tried a little bit of everyone else's (the debris sandwich was phenomenal too). Large portions and great food! I'll be back next time I'm in town."},{"business_id":"iSRTaT9WngzB8JJ2YKJUig","review_id":"cqXx2yK9e8Sn10sUwmEOOA","date":"2017-06-11T18:35:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9373857975006104,"text_excerpt":"This place is probably a 4.5/5 stars for me... but I'm leaning towards 5 stars for that Southern hospitality! We came here around 9:30AM, and was so disappointed to find that a lot of their famous dishes aren't available until 10:30AM!! Definitely wish I would've known when I was reading those Yelp reviews! We got a Famous Ferdi Po'boy to share between my boyfriend and myself, since we couldn't order the other food. I normally isn't a fan of po'boy, but I got to admit that it was pretty good. Their ham though.. it was just whatever to me. After sharing the Ferdi po'boy.. we walked around the area for a while to digest the food we just ate, and to wait till 10:30AM because we wanted to giv..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"iSRTaT9WngzB8JJ2YKJUig","photo_id":"VFG5aJDwTB9-MvnonvE1NA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/VFG5aJDwTB9-MvnonvE1NA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.869333028793335},{"business_id":"iSRTaT9WngzB8JJ2YKJUig","photo_id":"DvKrW0fAV7Cpnv4OpMM7Zg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DvKrW0fAV7Cpnv4OpMM7Zg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.867662250995636},{"business_id":"iSRTaT9WngzB8JJ2YKJUig","photo_id":"FhIs4Hbgp8UEDgsk5gCXAQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/FhIs4Hbgp8UEDgsk5gCXAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8650860786437988},{"business_id":"iSRTaT9WngzB8JJ2YKJUig","photo_id":"yo-SyxxlodOhhQd7LA5kjQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/yo-SyxxlodOhhQd7LA5kjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7783780694007874},{"business_id":"iSRTaT9WngzB8JJ2YKJUig","photo_id":"gvB2fMM_N8IxCwhI9Hw5Dw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/gvB2fMM_N8IxCwhI9Hw5Dw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7341046333312988}]},"notebook_case":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"case_type":"A — Visual Top-20 Gain","user_row":1483,"user_id":"5Nl6vX1LSbd3K1KBkOVtxQ","business_id":"iSRTaT9WngzB8JJ2YKJUig","business_name":"Mother's Restaurant","nv_rank":56,"mm_rank":18,"rank_improvement":38,"training_history_count":5,"target_category_count":12,"target_categories_supported_by_history":6,"target_category_support_fraction":0.5,"target_has_visual":true,"selected_image_count